 <p class="mb-8 text-xl leading-relaxed text-ash">A plain-English glossary for owners and managers buying their first batch of branded workwear. What to call them, what they're for, and how to pick the right one for your crew.</p>
 <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 border-t border-hairline pt-6 font-mono text-sm text-ash">
