<p class="mb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">Bighorn Threads manages apparel programs for Las Vegas businesses. Selected production partners handle approved decoration. Send your logo, product list, crew sizes, and deadline for a quote.</p>
 <a href="/get-a-quote/" class="btn-primary text-base">Get a Quote →</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </article>
</BaseLayout>
